## 第三步：云数据库（21 集合）
users / staff / wine_products / inventory / orders / return_requests / reviews /
coupon_templates / points_products / points_log / points_exchanges / rankings /
ads / notices / activities / card_banner / cards / card_kinds / card_trades /
